Enterprise System Architecture Specification
Version: 2.4 Enterprise Release
Security Level: Internal Confidential

Architecture:
- Frontend: React 18, Tailwind CSS, Vite, Real-Time WebSockets
- Backend: Node.js, Express, MongoDB (Mongoose), Socket.IO
- Multi-Tenancy: Scoped organization isolation via tenant middleware
- Scalability: Microservices-ready REST API with JWT bearer authorization
